## Roles

Defined in `{{HARNESS_DIR}}/agents/`. Use them as subagents where supported; otherwise read the role file and act as that role in the main conversation, one at a time. Roles never cross a ⛔ gate.

`research-lead` (routes, never skips gates) · `experiment-designer` (drafts cards; refuses more than one change) · `analyst` (configs, launchers, analysis; runs smoke tests) · `skeptic` (read-only; tries to refute verdicts) · `scribe` (notebook and registry) · `literature-scout` (read-only literature search).

