## Context and session recovery

Keep this file short; long procedures live in skills. Compact between unrelated tasks with the harness's context commands ({{CONTEXT_COMMANDS}}). Durable truth lives in artifacts, not chat: after any resume, rewind or compaction, read `notebook/NOTEBOOK.md § Resume here`, then reconcile `registry.json` and the cards against `results/` — artifacts win.

